dingJoinPoints</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Data/HashMap/Basic.html#Std.HashMap\">Std.HashMap</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a> (<a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.JoinPoint\">JoinPoint</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Jump\">Jump</a></span>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The join points whose RHS goal `vcgen` has yet to process, keyed by that goal, with their\njumps so far.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State.pendingJoinPoints","kind":"def","line":242,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State.pendingJoinPoints","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.lean#L242-L242"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State.inlineHandledInvariants\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">inlineHandledInvariants</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Data/HashSet/Basic.html#Std.HashSet\">Std.HashSet</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Set of invariant numbers that have been inline-elaborated by `Driver.emitVC` via\n`tryInlineInvariant`. The post-hoc invariant elaboration in `Frontend` consults\nthis to know which user-provided alts have already been consumed (so it doesn't\nwarn about them).","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State.inlineHandledInvariants","kind":"def","line":239,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State.inlineHandledInvariants","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.lean#L239-L239"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State.fuel\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">fuel</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/VCGen/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Fuel\">Do.Fuel</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Remaining VC-generation steps. Initialized from `Context.config.stepLimit` (or\n`.unlimited` when no limit is set). Decremented at each successful program-shape\nstep (`tryLetHoist`, `trySplit`, `tryFvarZeta`, `applySpec`). When exhausted,\n`solve` short-circuits and emits the current goal as a VC.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State.fuel","kind":"def","line":233,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State.fuel","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.lean#L233-L233"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State.simpState\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">simpState</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.State\">Meta.Sym.Simp.State</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Persistent cache of `Context.simpMethods`. Threading this cache across VCGen iterations avoids\nre-simplifying shared subexpressions (e.g., `s + 1 + 1 + ...` chains).","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State.simpState","kind":"def","line":226,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State.simpState","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.lean#L226-L226"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State.vcs\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">vcs</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"