ean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">Lean.MVarId</a> → <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">Lean.MVarId</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.JoinPoint\">Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.JoinPoint</a></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.JoinPoint.mk","kind":"ctor","line":145,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.JoinPoint.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.lean#L145-L157"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.JoinPoint\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">JoinPoint</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A join point `__do_jp` that `vcgen +jp` proves once. See `Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.JoinPoint`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.JoinPoint","kind":"structure","line":145,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.JoinPoint","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.lean#L145-L157"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.untilPat?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">untilPat?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Pattern.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Pattern\">Meta.Sym.Pattern</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The `until` pattern: when `some pat`, VC generation stops and emits the current goal as a VC\nonce the program in `wp⟦e⟧` matches `pat`, before applying a spec.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.untilPat?","kind":"def","line":143,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.untilPat?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.lean#L143-L143"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.invariantAlts\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">invariantAlts</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Data/HashMap/Basic.html#Std.HashMap\">Std.HashMap</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Pre-parsed `invariants`/`invariants?` alternatives, indexed by 1-based invariant\nnumber. Bullet form maps positions to entries (`bullet n+1 → alt`); labelled form maps\nthe parsed `inv<n>` numbers (out-of-order labels are supported). Empty when no\n`invariants` clause is provided or in `invariants?` (suggest) mode (handled separately).","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.invariantAlts","kind":"def","line":140,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.invariantAlts","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.lean#L140-L140"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.internalize\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">internalize</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The `internalize` config option: when `true` (default), `emitVC` and the\nmulti-subgoal fork in `Driver.work` call `Grind.processHypotheses`. The tactic-mode\nentry point disables this when there is no `with` clause.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.internalize","kind":"def","line":135,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.internalize","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.lean#L135-L135"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.debug\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">debug</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The `debug` config option: when `true`, `tryApplyRule` retries failed\n`BackwardRule.apply` calls after `unfoldReducible` and reports an error when the\nretry succeeds, pinpointing missing normalization steps in `vcgen`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.debug","kind":"def","line":131,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.debug","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.lean#L131-L131"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.errorOnMissingSpec\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">errorOnMissingSpec</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The `errorOnMissingSpec` config option: when `true` (default), a program with no matching\nspec raises a hard error. When `false`, the goal is emitted as an unsolved VC for the user to\ndischarge — useful with `vcgen [-some_spec]` patterns where the user knows the spec is\nintentionally removed and wants to handle the residual goal by hand.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.errorOnMissingSpec","kind":"def","line":127,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.errorOnMissingSpec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.lean#L127-L127"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.useJP\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">useJP</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The `jp` config option: when `true`, `tryLetIntro` recognises `__do_jp` lets\nwhose body is a splitter and sets up shared-continuation handling instead of\nzeta-unfolding. When `false` (default, matching original `mvcgen`), every call\nsite of the JP zeta-unfolds, leading to exponential blow-up on nested splits.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.useJP","kind":"def","line":122,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.useJP","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.lean#L122-L122"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.simpConfig\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">simpConfig</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Config\">Meta.Sym.Simp.Config</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The configuration of every `Sym.simp` run with `simpMethods`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.simpConfig","kind":"def","line":117,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.simpConfig","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.lean#L117-L117"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.simpMethods\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">simpMethods</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Methods\">Meta.Sym.Simp.Methods</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The `Sym.simp` methods that rewrite hypotheses, state arguments and verification conditions\nwith the `@[vcgen_simp]` theorems and those of the `simp [...]` clause. `none` when the `simp`\nconfig option is `false`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.simpMethods","kind":"def","line":115,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.simpMethods","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.lean#L115-L115"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.rintros\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">rintros</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/DiscrTree/Types.html#Lean.Meta.DiscrTree\">Meta.DiscrTree</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/RIntroAttr.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.RIntroEntry\">RIntroEntry</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The `@[vcgen_rintro]` rules, keyed by their conclusion.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.rintros","kind":"def","line":111,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.Context.rintros","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.lean#L111-L111"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/Context.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic